,"shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"c3gwn7_ukRwGGIghHLi-UA","review_id":"4bGOlpbvbunvrX_9pmeWFw","date":"2019-04-18T15:34:31","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9410020112991333,"text_excerpt":"We visited Toast on the recommendation from a friend who lives in New Orleans. Aebleskivers (puffed pancake balls with powdered sugar) are to die for - especially when you dip them in the lemon curd. There were other jellies and caramel, too. My wife had the classic breakfast with crispy bacon and some of the best grits around - and that's coming from a South Carolinian. Our friend had the omelette with spinach, bacon and Gruyere. I had the savory crepe with cheese and herbs. The portions here are plentiful, so come hungry. The coffee was endless and quite tasty. The wait staff was affable and fun! The servers kind of tag-teamed our table, and Mike was the most memorable. Don't miss a bre..."},{"business_id":"c3gwn7_ukRwGGIghHLi-UA","review_id":"jkSJgC4CZgCLU0SY3rWfgQ","date":"2019-08-10T16:57:35","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9399473667144775,"text_excerpt":"Toast was soooooo good! We did no wait through yelp. It was perfect. We walked in and were seated right away. It's a small spot but it feels cozy not crowded. Once we were seated the waitress came right away and gave us some advice on what was good. We decided on the blueberry crepes, steak and potatoes, and bacon. The steak was cooked perfectly and the aioli was delicious. My crepes were good and not overly sweet. I ate it very quickly because it was that good. It is in my neighborhood so I have every intention on going back again. They do have a bar so I plan to try the hibiscus mimosa next time. Also I love that they left the us a carafe of water in the table. Tip: go early or get on t..."},{"business_id":"c3gwn7_ukRwGGIghHLi-UA","review_id":"FdACIDIumBIzcP7hRl-Kgw","date":"2019-05-27T01:33:47","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9346988797187805,"text_excerpt":"The food here is good. The toast is really good. I had the toast with cream cheese, cured salmon and scrambled egg. The best part about it was the toast; but the salmon was buttery and delicious too. We also had the Abelskivers which are just glorified pancakes. The only difference between them and pancakes is that the Abelskivers are round. The service here is good, and the server we had was really accommodating to our party. The restaurant is kind of a tight squeeze, so if you don't mind eating outside you should consider that."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"c3gwn7_ukRwGGIghHLi-UA","photo_id":"n4FF2Kuc7aguq0j33z_mjQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/n4FF2Kuc7aguq0j33z_mjQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8889076113700867},{"business_id":"c3gwn7_ukRwGGIghHLi-UA","photo_id":"2wi_tfwhA_-PgS-GH9C9Jg","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/2wi_tfwhA_-PgS-GH9C9Jg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8676928281784058},{"business_id":"c3gwn7_ukRwGGIghHLi-UA","photo_id":"aCHZaChPgkQCuOQYWwGx1g","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/aCHZaChPgkQCuOQYWwGx1g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.843104898929596},{"business_id":"c3gwn7_ukRwGGIghHLi-UA","photo_id":"AWI3Jn_B8xDPOAV7jo6CLw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/AWI3Jn_B8xDPOAV7jo6CLw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7803497314453125},{"business_id":"c3gwn7_ukRwGGIghHLi-UA","photo_id":"NkY8LSgAO8WE5ot416OYnA","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/NkY8LSgAO